{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43297","headline":"玄元皇帝应见贺圣祚无疆 · 赵铎","name":"玄元皇帝应见贺圣祚无疆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主今司契，神功格上玄。\n岂唯求[傅]野，更有叶钧天。\n审梦西山下，焚香北阙前。\n道光尊圣日，福应集灵年。\n咫尺真容近，巍峩大象悬。\n觞从百寮献，形爲万方传。\n声教唯皇矣，英威固邈然。\n惭无美周颂，徒上祝尧篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵铎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}